lic eye talk about  the reasons why they go to therapy what  happens to therapy  and the the degree of the issues that  cause them to go to therapy i think that  would uh  in a way preserve and protect  the the sanctity  and the effectiveness of therapy  regardless of how you practice it  and that is a wonderful point to end the  show thank you so much for coming on if  people want to find you where is the  best place to do that well i i'm now  you know delivering a you know public  workshops two-hour workshops oh by the  way all the training i do is not for  profit  so i charge as little as i can and a  third of all the revenues that i  generate go to the charity shelter  uh because of the connection between  mental health and homelessness  andrew thomas thank you so much for  coming on the show well thank you very  much i mean it's been really interesting  really fascinating to meet you and talk  to you thank you very much likewise and  uh thank you for watching and listening  we will see you very soon with another  interview uh all of them go out at 7 00  pm uk time and of course you can catch a  raw show as well we've got those four  nights a week 7 p.m uk time 2 p.m  eastern take care and see you soon guys  we hope you've enjoyed this incredible  interview remember to subscribe and hit  the bell button so that you never miss  another fantastic episode and if you  believe that the work we do here at  trigonometry is important support us by  joining our locals community using the  link below
 

